{"seq":4,"slug":"emerging-threats","title":"新兴威胁防御","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/emerging-threats","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ddos-mitigation","title":"DDoS 攻击防御体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/emerging-threats/ddos-mitigation","wordCount":2950,"readingTime":12},{"seq":2,"slug":"iot-ot-security","title":"IoT/OT 网络安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/emerging-threats/iot-ot-security","wordCount":3100,"readingTime":13},{"seq":3,"slug":"5g-cloud-native-security","title":"5G 与云原生网络安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/emerging-threats/5g-cloud-native-security","wordCount":3029,"readingTime":13}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"新兴威胁防御-简介\">新兴威胁防御 简介</h1><p>本章聚焦网络安全领域的前沿挑战，帮助读者理解和应对快速演进的新型网络威胁。</p>\n<p>第一节<strong>DDoS 攻击防御体系</strong>全面解析分布式拒绝服务攻击的类型演变、多层防御架构设计，以及基于 AI 的自适应 DDoS 缓解策略，覆盖从网络层到应用层的完整防护方案。</p>\n<p>第二节<strong>IoT/OT 网络安全</strong>探讨物联网与工控系统面临的独特安全挑战，包括受限设备的安全协议、IT/OT 融合环境的分段策略，以及 Purdue 模型在现代工控环境中的演进。</p>\n<p>第三节<strong>5G 与云原生网络安全</strong>剖析 5G 网络架构（网络切片、MEC 边缘计算）和云原生网络（Service Mesh、eBPF）带来的新安全范式，以及相应的防护策略与最佳实践。</p>\n"}